- Larnaca Salt Lake: Larnaca Salt Lake (Greek: Αλυκή Λάρνακας , Turkish: "Larnaka Tuz Gölü" ) is a complex network of four salt lakes (3 of them interconnected) of different sizes to the west of the city of Larnaca. The largest is lake "Aliki", followed by lake "Orphani", lake "Soros" and lake "Spiro"
